        "official_en_sha256": "7a6000b8650ac02234d3954faf394a624fccf073d2aeae8f1071c164624a3440"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "さっきの兵士も話していた。\r\n不死身の兵のからくりはそういうことだったのか。",
        "official_en": "That soldier earlier mentioned wraiths... Them being undead would explain things.",
        "real_en": "That soldier we met earlier mentioned it, too. So that's the secret behind the invincible soldiers..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
