        "official_en_sha256": "a0ef199f001f2198f58ce6f039fb0fb35d499a95e60fcd7670599097ad7c77e4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その証拠に、\r\nポーションやフェニックスの尾を\r\n嫌っているようでした。",
        "official_en": "I say this because the potions and phoenix downs we threw at them seemed to cause them great anguish.",
        "real_en": "They seemed to hate Potions and Phoenix Downs. That's how we could tell."
      },
      "review": {
