      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レイン殿、敵は普通の兵ではなく\r\n死霊の類かと……。",
        "official_en": "Sir Rain, I believe they are no ordinary soldiers, but some manner of undead.",
        "real_en": "Rain-dono, I believe our enemies aren't ordinary soldiers, but some kind of undead..."
